<title>USA: Channell Commercial completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Channell Commercial completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>TEMECULA, Calif. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channell Commercial Corp, a maker of telecommunications equipment, Thursday completed its acquisition of Standby Electronics Corp, a privately held maker of products that house electronics.</p>
<p>&quot;Standby's enclosures and technical expertise fill an area in network construction which Channell's existing product line does not cover,&quot; William Channell, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.  Standby is based in Mississauga, Ontario.  Channell said it plans to move into a larger Mississauga facility and merge its Canadian office with Standby's.</p>
</text>
